  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cultivation and High Quality Job Creation Support Project of Cyber Security Experts in Vietnam via [Online and Offline Cyber Security Training Platform]</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to successfully build this Online/Offline Cybersecurity Training Center, we select an equipment company, procure HW and SW training programs, and install the training programs. Installation of personal PCs and equipment (books/benches) for training in Online/Offline Cyber Security Training Center. Development of localized online/offline training curriculum and teaching materials tailored to the situation of the recipient country. Cultivating local NTU cyber security education and training instructors by  our company and Korean experts. Including NTU, other universities, vocational education institutions, public institutions, and BOP-focused ICT-related/non-major students (prospective graduates) of them are selected to conduct cyber security training for improving capabilities against cyber attack such as detection, blocking and response technology. NTU/DUDU IT Co., Ltd. grants private license to trainees who have passed the prescribed qualification test</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vietnam currently lacks human and physical infrastructure for nurturing cyber security experts. Therefore, the purpose of this project is to build an Online and Offline Cyber Security Training Center in the NTU to greatly improve the human and physical infrastructure that can convert the theory centered cyber security education and training system to practice-oriented. Vietnam current cyber security experts&apos; ability to detect, block, and respond to cyber attacks in advance is very poor. Therefore, using online and offline platform at low cost, practical cyber breaches focused on ICT majors, including the vulnerable groups in small and medium-sized cities and rural areas of Khanh Hoa Province,&#xB098;&#xD2B8;&#xB791; &#xC815;&#xBCF4;&#xD1B5;&#xC2E0;&#xB300;&#xD559; &#xB0B4; &#xC815;&#xADDC;&#xACFC;&#xC815; &#xAD50;&#xACFC; &#xC6B4;&#xC601;, &#xAD50;&#xC721;&#xD6C8;&#xB828; &#xC218;&#xB8CC;&#xC0DD; &#xCDE8;&#xC5C5;&#xB960; &#xC81C;&#xACE0;, BOP &#xC218;&#xB8CC;&#xC0DD; &#xCDE8;&#xC5C5;&#xB960; &#xC81C;&#xACE0;</narrative>
  </description>
